<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>We've Rebranded — Challenge Rush</title>
<meta name="description" content="We've moved and rebranded to Challenge Rush. Click through to play at challengerush.com.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.ico">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="10; url=https://challengerush.com/">
<style>
@font-face {
font-family: "Electrolize";
src: url("Electrolize-Regular.ttf") format("truetype");
font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap;
}
:root {
--bg: #060d0b;
--bg-soft: #0b1512;
--ink: #eafff4;
--ink-dim: #9fc7b6;
--accent: #3dff9e;
--accent-rgb: 61, 255, 158;
--accent-2: #17c88b;
--accent-2-rgb: 23, 200, 139;
--accent-3: #b9ff3d;
--line: rgba(61, 255, 158, 0.16);
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
min-height: 100vh;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
padding: 32px 20px;
background:
radial-gradient(1100px 620px at 50% -10%, rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.14), transparent 62%),
radial-gradient(900px 500px at 100% 110%, rgba(23, 200, 139, 0.10), transparent 60%),
var(--bg);
color: var(--ink);
font-family: "Electrolize", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
line-height: 1.65;
-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
text-align: center;
.card {
width: 100%;
max-width: 580px;
background: rgba(15, 28, 23, 0.72);
border: 1px solid var(--line);
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 48px 34px 40px;
box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.05);
backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
.kicker {
display: inline-block;
padding: 6px 15px;
border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.4);
border-radius: 999px;
background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.06);
color: var(--accent);
font-size: 0.78rem;
letter-spacing: 0.14em;
text-transform: uppercase;
margin-bottom: 26px;
.rebrand-row {
gap: 18px;
margin-bottom: 30px;
flex-wrap: nowrap;
.brand-old {
height: 25px;
width: auto;
display: block;
opacity: 0.55;
filter: grayscale(0.6);
.brand-new {
filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.5));
.arrow {
width: 30px; height: 30px;
flex: none;
animation: nudge 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
@keyframes nudge {
0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
50% { transform: translateX(6px); }
h1 {
font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 5vw, 2.35rem);
font-weight: 400;
letter-spacing: 0.04em;
margin-bottom: 14px;
background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-3));
-webkit-background-clip: text;
background-clip: text;
color: transparent;
text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.25);
.lead {
color: var(--ink-dim);
font-size: 1.04rem;
max-width: 46ch;
margin: 0 auto 30px;
.lead strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 400; }
.cta {
display: inline-flex;
gap: 10px;
padding: 15px 30px;
border: 2px solid rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.55);
border-radius: 12px;
background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.08);
font-family: inherit;
font-size: 1.05rem;
letter-spacing: 0.02em;
text-decoration: none;
transition: background 0.16s, border-color 0.16s, box-shadow 0.16s, transform 0.16s;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0);
.cta:hover {
background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.16);
border-color: var(--accent);
box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.4);
transform: translateY(-1px);
.countdown {
margin-top: 24px;
font-size: 0.86rem;
.countdown a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
.countdown a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.countdown #secs { color: var(--accent); }
.cta .cta-ico { width: 22px; height: 22px; display: block; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
.arrow { animation: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="card">
<span class="kicker">We've Rebranded</span>
<div class="rebrand-row">
<img class="brand-old" src="dashmetry-logo-f81x35.webp" alt="Dashmetry (previous brand)">
<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg>
<img class="brand-new" src="challenge-rush-logo.webp" alt="Challenge Rush">
</div>
<h1>Same game, new home</h1>
<p class="lead"><strong>Dashmetry</strong> is now <strong>Challenge Rush</strong>. All your levels, scores and the leaderboard have moved with us — they're waiting at the new address.</p>
<a class="cta" href="https://challengerush.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
<img class="cta-ico" src="icon_home_play.png" alt="">
Continue to challengerush.com
</a>
<p class="countdown">Redirecting automatically in <span id="secs">10</span>s… <a href="https://challengerush.com/">go now</a></p>
</main>
<script>
(function () {
var el = document.getElementById('secs');
if (!el) return;
var n = parseInt(el.textContent, 10) || 10;
var timer = setInterval(function () {
n -= 1;
if (n <= 0) { el.textContent = '0'; clearInterval(timer); return; }
el.textContent = String(n);
}, 1000);
})();
</script>
<script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v4513226cdae34746b4dedf0b4dfa099e1781791509496" integrity="sha512-ZE9pZaUXND66v380QUtch/5sE9tPFh2zg45pR2PB0CVkCtOREv2AJKkSidISWkysEuQ0EH8faUU5du78bx87UQ==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"e07ec6062a474a569b00f9f6510c6ee3","r":1}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>